---
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components';
---

<div class="card-purple mt-12 mb-8">
  <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-primary-600 flex items-center justify-center">
      <Icon name="line-md:document-list" class="text-white text-2xl" />
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-0 dark:text-white">Executive Summary</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-primary-900 font-medium dark:text-primary-200">The TL;DR of this case study</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-6">
    <div class="bg-white/80 rounded-lg p-4 dark:bg-black/20">
      <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary-600 mb-1">6000+</div>
      <div class="text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-400">Engineers Enabled</div>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-white/80 rounded-lg p-4 dark:bg-black/20">
      <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary-600 mb-1">67%</div>
      <div class="text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-400">UI Bugs Reduced</div>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-white/80 rounded-lg p-4 dark:bg-black/20">
      <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary-600 mb-1">60%</div>
      <div class="text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-400">Developer Adoption</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed"><strong>My role:</strong> Engineering Director with full technical and organizational ownership. I made architectural decisions, set the technical roadmap, directed a team of 7 engineers, secured executive buy-in, and delivered measurable ROI (267%) within 6 months.</p>
  <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mt-3"><strong>The challenge:</strong> How do you maintain frontend quality when most engineers aren't frontend experts? We had 6000+ engineers shipping UI code—but only 12% claimed to be frontend specialists. The result: 67% of UI bugs from component misuse, 33% accessibility compliance, and frontend experts bottlenecked reviewing 200+ PRs/week.</p>
  <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mt-3"><strong>The solution:</strong> Frontend quality gating platform with real-time IDE validation, progressive CI/CD quality gates, and intelligent tooling. Shifting quality left from code review to development time.</p>
</div>

<div class="bg-amber-50 rounded-lg p-6 mb-8 border border-amber-200 dark:bg-amber-600/10 dark:border-amber-600/40">
  <h4 class="font-semibold mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
    <Icon name="line-md:star-filled" class="text-amber-600" />What I'm Most Proud Of: Culture change, developer empowerment, and direct impact on products!
  </h4>
  <p class="text-sm text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-400">Performance budgets are now a consistent part of the development process. Median page bundle reduced from <strong>420KB → 185KB</strong>.
  While I don't have specific metrics for client satisfaction, we can say the feedback has been positive from our development teams and is reflected in NPS scores.</p>
</div>
